# Docgen — Project Intelligence

## Mission constant
`APP_NAME = "Docgen"` — keep the working name in one constant.

## Non-negotiables
- LLM never controls layout or colors.
- Format-only: never accept free text from the LLM; resolve spans only.
- Prefer content fidelity, accessibility (WCAG AA), and determinism when ambiguous.
- Work phase by phase; do not start next phase until acceptance gates pass.
- No features outside AGENTS.md until all acceptance criteria pass.

## Architecture reminders
- Theme Engine → Ingest → Structurer → Renderer → Verifier
- Rules fallback must work offline (`LLM_PROVIDER=none`)
- Real OXML: TOC field, PAGE/NUMPAGES, pgBorders, table shading

## Phase status
Phase 1 (core engine) — complete
Phases 2–5 — implemented; polish optional
Revision 2: WP0–WP5 complete
Revision 3: WP-A–E–C–D implemented (corner fix, hug/margin, formats/*.yaml, ambient glow, Docgen Body + dates)
PDF: `PDF_ENGINE=native` Jagrook-grade PyMuPDF (cover, TOC leaders, brand tables, header/footer); LibreOffice optional

## Preferences discovered
- Spec lives in AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / .cursor/rules/project.mdc
- Memory bank under memory-bank/ must stay current
- Frontend lives in `frontend/`; never put secrets in NEXT_PUBLIC_* except API URL
- Design: Paper #F6F2EA / Darkroom #0B0B12; no purple-on-white; CSS vars/@theme only
- Prefer native PDF over LibreOffice dependency

